      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step 1: Pick a Pivot\nSelect a benchmark item.\nUsually last item A[high].\nEverything compares to it!",
      "originalText": "Step 1: Pick a Pivot\nSelect a benchmark item.\nUsually last item A[high].\nEverything compares to it!",
